{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.poster.avif?t=1758296248\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.webm?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/4c2d7ef9dacfa27d90b468fefc3bb428.mp4?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Be charmed by the cute and colorful world of <strong>Shroomtopia</strong>! Relax in this wholesome slow-paced puzzle game while exploring serene landscapes and solving diverse challenges. Manipulate the hexagonal soil and blend the colors. Only you can bring nature back to life!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.poster.avif?t=1758296248\" width=616 height=272 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.webm?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/023632a00e942747d572d1de50405411.mp4?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Unleash your creativity with a built-in level editor Become a level designer with this intuitive but powerful tool.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.poster.avif?t=1758296248\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.webm?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/extras/1bf3f0257973a6cdf0ee51bad2e84a62.mp4?t=1758296248\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>And more: <br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>\ud83c\udf44 Discover 5 diverse and colorful biomes</strong> <br>A real 2D eye candy full of cute mushroom characters and animated weather effects.<br></li><li>\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>75 levels packed with puzzles gradually increasing in challenge </strong><br>Train your brain through logical problems - can you beat all of them?<br></li><li>\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Share your designs and play other fan-made maps thanks to the Steam Workshop </strong><br>Upload the newly made creations, share them with your friends and other fans, and get feedback.<br></li><li>\ud83c\udfb6 <strong>Relax to the soothing soundtrack made by the indie music producer Felipe Peticov Breathe in, breathe out. </strong><br>What a better way to unwind than these beautiful instrumental sounds?</li></ul></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2483440?t=1758296248","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758296248","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758296248","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2483440/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758296248","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play on TV","id":43},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":